{"title":"Career roadmap · Language Analyst","role":"Language Analyst","summary":"A Language Analyst studies language structure, usage, meaning, speech patterns and language data. Depending on specialisation, the role can involve computational linguistics, NLP, speech technology, translation/localisation, language research, language assessment or linguistic analysis.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Linguistics"},"about":[{"label":"Alignment","text":"Strong alignment"}],"intro":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"A BA in Linguistics can provide the foundation, but technical language-analysis roles increasingly require computational, statistical and programming skills."}]}],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Typical route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["BA Linguistics","Linguistic Research/NLP Internship","Language Data Analyst / Linguistic Analyst","Language Analyst","Senior Language Analyst","Language Specialist / Computational Linguist","Language Technology Lead / Research Lead"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build linguistics fundamentals, research methods, language-data analysis, Python and basic NLP."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in computational linguistics, speech, localisation, language assessment or language research."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Lead language datasets, NLP evaluation, linguistic research or localisation programmes."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move toward Computational Linguist, Language Technology Lead, Research Lead, Language AI Specialist or independent consultant."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Linguistic foundations"},{"text":"Phonetics